            <link>https://martinrariga.com</link>
            <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>Snippetbar now tags each request to OpenAI with an anonymous identifier for
your install, so usage can be told apart per copy rather than arriving as one
undifferentiated stream. The identifier is derived from your license
activation. No text you run through Snippetbar is affected, and nothing new
about you is sent.</p>
]]></description>
